{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓國人氣女團IVE成員張元英最近登上時尚雜誌封面，為其代言的鐘錶首飾品牌拍攝寫真，她穿上吊帶裙、露肩裝及皮褸等服裝，大晒香肩和招牌長腿，配襯耳環、頸鏈、手鏈和手錶的首飾，散發高貴優雅氣質。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T14:23:55.100444+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":106,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T14:02:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:15.010806+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T14:17:15.010806+00:00","content_hash":"25fda1e21bc8d224e773ca2c9bedf7992b1f6b70ec847dc1c915383ed14bf78b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}